    Properly sort the docs version (#7713)
    
    This PR adds sorting to the list of documentation versions. The current
    setup sorts numerically, by page. So we have 8.x, 7.x ... 2.0.x, 20.x,
    19.x.
    
    This PR stabilizes this by sorting in the generation process itself.
    
    ### How to test this patch
    
    Run the generation script and make sure the versions.js file looks right
    and is sorted. Open the generated index.html file to make sure as well.
    
